---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import TechIcon from '../components/TechIcon.astro';
import ServiceIcon from '../components/ServiceIcon.astro';
import PostCard from '../components/PostCard.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { expertise } from '../data/expertise';
import { featuredTechnologies } from '../data/technologies';
import { caseStudies } from '../data/caseStudies';
const services=(await getCollection('services')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order);
const posts=(await getCollection('blog',({data})=>!data.draft)).sort((a,b)=>b.data.date.valueOf()-a.data.date.valueOf()).slice(0,3);
const steps=[
 {title:'Understand',text:'Start with the people using the software, the business problem, and the systems already in place.'},
 {title:'Define',text:'Agree on a useful outcome, a practical scope, and the technical decisions that support it.'},
 {title:'Build',text:'Connect the interface, application logic, and integrations into a coherent experience.'},
 {title:'Prepare to launch',text:'Review the visitor journey, deployment needs, and the way the software will be maintained.'}
];
---
<Base>
<section class="hero-section"><div class="wrap hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> KURIAN BENNY / SENIOR FULL-STACK DEVELOPER & DEVOPS</p><h1>Build resilient software.<br /><em>Launch with<br />confidence.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Twelve years of full-stack development and DevOps experience. I help founders and teams build scalable web applications, modernize legacy backend systems, and deploy cloud infrastructure that runs reliably in production.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Let’s discuss your project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#case-studies">Explore practical work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Full-stack web applications.</span><span>Legacy modernization.</span><span>Cloud & DevOps reliability.</span></div></div><div class="portrait-composition"><div class="portrait-frame"><img src="/kurian-benny.jpg" alt="Kurian Benny, software developer" width="800" height="800" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="portrait-caption"><span>THE PERSON BEHIND THE CODE</span><strong>Kurian Benny</strong></div></div><div class="experience-ticket"><strong>12<span>years</span></strong><p>of development<br />experience</p><span class="ticket-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><div class="portrait-note"><span class="dot"></span> FROM APPLICATION TO PRODUCTION</div></div></div></section>
<section class="stack-strip" aria-labelledby="toolkit-heading"><div class="wrap"><div class="toolkit-heading"><h2 id="toolkit-heading">A toolkit for the whole project.</h2><p>From web interfaces and backend APIs to data, cloud hosting, and production.</p></div><div class="technology-list">{featuredTechnologies.map(name=><div class="technology-tile"><TechIcon name={name} /><span>{name}</span></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="about" class="wrap section about"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / A LITTLE BACKGROUND</p><h2>Built on experience.<br /><em>Driven by context.</em></h2><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Get to know me <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="lead">I’m a full-stack developer with twelve years of experience across web applications, APIs, content platforms, and the infrastructure that supports them.</p><p>My toolkit spans React and Next.js, PHP frameworks including Laravel, Symfony, and CodeIgniter, Python frameworks including Django Ninja and FastAPI, and Ruby on Rails.</p><p>I also work with MySQL and NoSQL databases, CMS platforms, and ERPNext, alongside AWS, DigitalOcean, VPS hosting, server management, and deployment. That breadth connects the development work with the realities of running it.</p><div class="about-principles"><span>Understand the problem.</span><span>Connect the pieces.</span><span>Make the next step clear.</span></div></div></section>
<section id="expertise" class="expertise-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / TECHNICAL PERSPECTIVE</p><h2>One application.<br /><em>Many connected parts.</em></h2></div><p class="section-description">A broad technical background helps me see how decisions in one layer affect the rest of the system.</p></div><div class="expertise-grid">{expertise.map(item=><div class="expertise-card"><span class="card-number">{item.number}</span><p class="eyebrow">{item.detail}</p><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><div class="tags">{item.technologies.map(tech=><span><TechIcon name={tech} />{tech}</span>)}</div></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / WORKING TOGETHER</p><h2>Where I can{' '}<em>help.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore all services <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map((service,index)=><a class="service-card" href={`/services/${service.id}/`}><div class="service-card-top"><span class="service-icon"><ServiceIcon index={index} /></span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p class="eyebrow">{service.data.label}</p><h3>{service.data.title}</h3><p>{service.data.description}</p><span class="text-link">Explore the service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>)}</div></section>
<section id="case-studies" class="case-studies-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / SELECTED WORK & CASE STUDIES</p><h2>Real problems.<br /><em>Reliable outcomes.</em></h2></div><div class="case-heading-side"><p class="section-description">A sample of how practical full-stack engineering and DevOps translate into business outcomes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Discuss your project <span>↗</span></a></div></div><div class="case-studies-grid">{caseStudies.map(item=><div class="case-study-card"><div class="case-study-top"><span class="card-number">{item.number}</span><span class="case-category">{item.category}</span></div><h3>{item.title}</h3><div class="case-study-body"><div class="case-detail"><strong>Challenge:</strong> <p>{item.challenge}</p></div><div class="case-detail"><strong>Solution:</strong> <p>{item.solution}</p></div><div class="case-detail case-outcome"><strong>Outcome:</strong> <p>{item.outcome}</p></div></div><div class="tags">{item.technologies.map(tech=><span><TechIcon name={tech} />{tech}</span>)}</div></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="approach-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">05 / FROM A QUESTION TO A PLAN</p><h2>Clarity before code.<br /><em>Purpose at every step.</em></h2></div><p class="section-description">A good starting point is understanding what needs to change. Here’s how I approach that conversation.</p></div><div class="process-grid">{steps.map((step,index)=><div class="process-step"><span>0{index+1}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section fit-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">06 / YOUR NEXT STEP</p><h2>Starting fresh?<br /><em>Improving what’s there?</em></h2><p class="section-description">The right starting point depends on where you are today. These are a few ways we can work together.</p></div><div class="fit-list"><a href="/services/web-applications/"><span>01</span><div><h3>You have a product or application idea.</h3><p>Turn the requirements into a practical development scope.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/services/backend-development/"><span>02</span><div><h3>Your existing system needs to evolve.</h3><p>Work through new features, integrations, and application improvements.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/services/ai-website-review/"><span>03</span><div><h3>You built a website with AI.</h3><p>Review the code, SEO foundations, and the path to a maintainable launch.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="writing-section"><div class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">07 / IDEAS & PRACTICAL GUIDES</p><h2>Notes from{' '}<em>the workbench.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/blog/">Read the blog <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="post-grid">{posts.map(post=><PostCard post={post} />)}</div></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section"><div class="wrap section"><div><p class="eyebrow">HAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?</p><h2>Let’s make the<br /><em>next step a useful one.</em></h2></div><div class="contact-bottom"><p>Share what you’re working on, what’s getting in the way, and what you’d like to achieve.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
